{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15948","headline":"促剌词 · 王建","name":"促剌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促剌复促剌，水中无鱼山无石。\n少年虽嫁不得归，头白犹着父母衣。\n田边旧宅非所有，我身不及逐鸡飞。\n出门若有归死处，猛虎当衢向前去。\n百年不遗踏君门，在家谁唤爲新妇。\n岂不见他邻舍娘，嫁来常在舅姑傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}